WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.080
- I'm gonna start with you, Jacob.

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:01.913
So be honest.

00:00:01.913 --> 00:00:03.720
After making Spider-Man,

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.482
what do you really do

00:00:05.482 --> 00:00:08.710
when you see a spider in
the room in real life?

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:10.080
A. Kill it.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.310
B. Try to take it outside or

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:16.800
C. Scream and have someone
else take care of it.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:17.633
Jacob, go.

00:00:17.633 --> 00:00:19.710
- So, basically my girlfriend

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.730
is really, really not
about hurting animals.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.070
So, I had to learn to like,

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:25.490
to just not be afraid

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:27.160
and scream like a little girl

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.320
and like, try to pick it up with a napkin

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.260
and kind of lead it out the window.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.140
Um, so I guess I'd do number two,

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:37.310
but inside I'm doing
number three all the time,

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:39.230
which is screaming like a girl.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.237
- I just simply love
that I got you to say,

00:00:41.237 --> 00:00:43.426
"I do number two and three sometimes."

00:00:43.426 --> 00:00:47.000
(everyone laughing and clapping)

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:47.833
That was-

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.290
Jacob, my God.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:51.134
I love you.

00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:53.045
So wait, (Kelly chuckles)

00:00:53.045 --> 00:00:54.370
Zendaya, what do you do?

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:55.520
Do you, what do you do?

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:56.353
A, B or C?

00:00:56.353 --> 00:00:57.440
Do you kill it?

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.273
Do you take it out

00:00:58.273 --> 00:01:00.300
or do you scream and go somebody get that?

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.133
- [Zendaya] I would actually-

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:02.480
- I'd just do, I do D.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:03.532
I just ignore it.

00:01:03.532 --> 00:01:05.018
(everyone laughs)

00:01:05.018 --> 00:01:05.858
I just let it be.

00:01:05.858 --> 00:01:07.553
- You ignore it.
- I'm just gonna

00:01:07.553 --> 00:01:08.457
leave it there, look away,

00:01:08.457 --> 00:01:09.720
you look back, it's gone.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:11.065
It's not my problem anymore.

00:01:11.065 --> 00:01:12.788
(laughs loudly)

00:01:12.788 --> 00:01:15.518
- What if it crawls up on
you while you're sleeping?

00:01:15.518 --> 00:01:18.060
- Well, the difference
is I live in England,

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.340
so none of the spiders
in England can kill you.

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:23.117
U.S. spiders here that can kill you.

00:01:23.117 --> 00:01:24.570
- Did you know spiders

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:26.500
can crawl into your mouth when you sleep?

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.333
- [Kelly] Yes!

00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:28.166
- Apparently, it happens
all the time, bro!

00:01:28.166 --> 00:01:28.999
- Yes.

00:01:28.999 --> 00:01:29.832
- [Kelly] Yes!

00:01:29.832 --> 00:01:30.665
- So, you should definitely
get rid of the spider.

00:01:30.665 --> 00:01:32.740
Maybe not kill it, but like get rid of it.

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:34.697
- I definitely take them outside.

00:01:34.697 --> 00:01:36.140
I take them outside.

00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:37.202
I don't like, I don't like,

00:01:37.202 --> 00:01:39.610
I think it's bad luck actually.

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:40.998
- Really?
- To kill one?

00:01:40.998 --> 00:01:42.163
Or to leave it outside?

00:01:42.163 --> 00:01:43.230
- Yeah, if you find one
you don't have to kill it.

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:45.550
I don't kill bugs in my
house, I take them outside.

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:46.580
It's just a general rule.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:48.990
I try to convert people
to doing that as well.

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:49.823
- You are good like that.

00:01:49.823 --> 00:01:51.280
I just see them as like little guests.

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:53.220
I'm like welcome to the house, man!

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:54.053
(Zendaya laughs)

00:01:54.053 --> 00:01:54.886
- Little guests!

00:01:54.886 --> 00:01:55.719
- [Tom] Can I get you anything?

00:01:55.719 --> 00:01:56.823
- [Zendaya] Your house
is just bug infested.

00:01:56.823 --> 00:01:57.996
- Yeah I love it.

00:01:57.996 --> 00:01:58.833
- Little roaches.

00:01:58.833 --> 00:02:00.580
- But also as Spider-Man,

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:02.580
I feel like you cannot kill a spider.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:04.828
- What if someone like, (indistinct)

00:02:04.828 --> 00:02:06.550
and its really weird?

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:07.690
In my car.

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:08.844
(Jacob laughs)

00:02:08.844 --> 00:02:10.406
- They've given you a nice car.

00:02:10.406 --> 00:02:12.147
- I'll be driving along, on the dashboard.

00:02:12.147 --> 00:02:13.300
- I love that, this angle,

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:15.582
you can see my socks and my sweatpants.

00:02:15.582 --> 00:02:18.415
(everyone laughs)

00:02:20.341 --> 00:02:23.721
(Kelly laughs loudly)

00:02:23.721 --> 00:02:24.838
- [Zendaya] No! No!

00:02:24.838 --> 00:02:25.940
- Oh my God!

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:29.545
Actually Zendaya, we couldn't
see that at all here.

00:02:29.545 --> 00:02:33.469
That is so awesome. (laughs loudly)

00:02:33.469 --> 00:02:34.883
I love Zoom!

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:39.170
Oh my God, that was me for
like a year on this show.

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:42.850
I literally had like a
blouse and like yoga pants,

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:44.743
I didn't do yoga and flip flops.

00:02:44.743 --> 00:02:45.960
(laughs loudly)

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:47.400
It was like, it was awesome!

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.553
Um, that was amazing.

